===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|Ἀριστοτέλης|lang=grc|sc=polytonic}}.

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# An ancient [[Greek]] [[philosopher]], logician, and scientist (382–322 BC), [[student]] of [[Plato]] and [[teacher]] of [[Alexander the Great]].
# A male [[given name]].

